WEBVTT

00:00:15.065 --> 00:00:20.975
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:26.745
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.745 --> 00:00:32.515
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.515 --> 00:00:37.455
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:43.295
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.295 --> 00:00:49.975
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:49.975 --> 00:00:55.675
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.675 --> 00:01:00.845
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.845 --> 00:01:06.655
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.655 --> 00:01:13.165
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.165 --> 00:01:18.835
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.835 --> 00:01:23.975
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:23.975 --> 00:01:27.735
Shine the light!

00:01:30.938 --> 00:01:35.178
I love Keisei... even now for sure...

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:36.578
What's the matter?

00:01:36.578 --> 00:01:38.068
Nothing.

00:01:39.408 --> 00:01:40.738
Kasuga-san?!

00:01:41.518 --> 00:01:42.848
Hey! Ah!

00:01:43.778 --> 00:01:45.088
Kasuga-san...

00:01:45.088 --> 00:01:47.348
Say, Ouri-kun...

00:01:47.348 --> 00:01:49.618
Kill... me...

00:01:57.428 --> 00:01:59.268
Ouri-kun...

00:01:59.268 --> 00:02:01.538
What're you thinking, Kasuga-san?!

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:05.108
Please! I wanna be happy.

00:02:05.108 --> 00:02:07.468
You're not making any sense!

00:02:08.738 --> 00:02:11.368
I... wanna be happy...

00:02:21.558 --> 00:02:24.828
Your eyes aren't playing tricks on you.

00:02:24.828 --> 00:02:26.758
You... again...

00:02:26.758 --> 00:02:28.088
Ouri-kun!

00:02:37.598 --> 00:02:40.598
Stop fooling around. Look closely.

00:02:54.448 --> 00:02:56.078
A balloon?

00:02:56.318 --> 00:02:59.018
You can see it?

00:03:00.328 --> 00:03:03.998
This isn't a balloon.

00:03:03.998 --> 00:03:05.968
This is my happiness.

00:03:05.968 --> 00:03:07.428
What?

00:03:07.428 --> 00:03:11.138
As I get happier,
it grows bigger and bigger,

00:03:11.138 --> 00:03:14.468
and it will bring about the ultimate death.

00:03:14.468 --> 00:03:17.308
Happy... death?

00:03:17.308 --> 00:03:22.948
That's right. So...
let me feel more happiness.

00:03:22.948 --> 00:03:24.778
Kasuga-san...

00:03:37.898 --> 00:03:39.528
What was that for?!

00:03:39.528 --> 00:03:45.468
I don't know what's going on,
but you need to wake up! Nozomi!

00:03:46.538 --> 00:03:48.308
Stay out of my way.

00:03:48.308 --> 00:03:50.908
Seriously, what's gotten into you?!

00:03:50.908 --> 00:03:53.978
Things at school have
gotten weird because of you!

00:03:53.978 --> 00:03:55.138
What?!

00:03:58.148 --> 00:03:59.908
I...

00:04:01.918 --> 00:04:04.758
wanna be happy. That's all.

00:04:04.758 --> 00:04:07.248
Kasuga-san... Ah!

00:04:14.168 --> 00:04:15.598
Are you okay?!

00:04:15.598 --> 00:04:20.508
Ever since you disappeared,
she's always been thinking about you.

00:04:20.508 --> 00:04:24.608
You're still saying that?!
Kasuga-san and I aren't...

00:04:24.608 --> 00:04:27.708
You may not understand it,

00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:30.778
but you don't need
a reason to love someone...

00:04:30.778 --> 00:04:35.548
even if the person you love doesn't
even have any feelings towards you.

00:04:38.088 --> 00:04:42.028
That tough feeling is
something that you can't...

00:04:42.028 --> 00:04:44.428
You can't help...

00:04:45.628 --> 00:04:48.928
I do understand it.

00:04:59.248 --> 00:05:04.238
Ouri... Don't ever
suddenly disappear on us again.

00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:11.318
Well?

00:05:11.318 --> 00:05:14.828
No. Ouri-kun isn't answering.

00:05:14.828 --> 00:05:18.228
What about those Inspectors
who headed to lkai High School?

00:05:18.228 --> 00:05:21.398
We still can't get in touch with them, either.

00:05:21.398 --> 00:05:22.598
What should we do?

00:05:22.598 --> 00:05:26.598
Shirae-san is the person in charge,
but he's still in the hospital.

00:05:29.778 --> 00:05:31.608
Hello. Makina-chan?

00:05:34.508 --> 00:05:38.178
Yes. I saw another
Seven Stars member then.

00:05:43.418 --> 00:05:46.788
Some balloon monster...
If I'm not mistaken, his name is "Toya."

00:05:46.788 --> 00:05:49.628
If it's him, I'll kill him.

00:05:49.628 --> 00:05:53.768
In any case, let me know what's
going on once you get to lkai High School.

00:05:53.768 --> 00:05:56.168
Itsuki and I will also head there now.

00:05:56.168 --> 00:05:59.938
No. There's a possibility that this is a decoy.

00:05:59.938 --> 00:06:02.878
Please guard the head temple, Guardian.

00:06:02.878 --> 00:06:04.468
But going by yourself is...

00:06:09.548 --> 00:06:13.788
Makinan is fired up again
since she thinks it's the Seven Stars.

00:06:13.788 --> 00:06:18.988
If Ouri-kun was with her, I don't think
things would turn out like before, but...

00:06:18.988 --> 00:06:21.288
That's it, I'm going!

00:06:21.288 --> 00:06:22.888
Wait.

00:06:23.198 --> 00:06:25.798
Makina Hoshimura is right.

00:06:25.798 --> 00:06:27.198
Having lost two members,

00:06:27.198 --> 00:06:30.728
there's a possibility that the Seven Stars
will launch a full-scale attack.

00:06:31.468 --> 00:06:36.008
Guardian Sougi, you two
stay in the head temple please.

00:06:36.008 --> 00:06:37.338
Okay.

00:06:38.208 --> 00:06:40.908
But then, Makina-chan and Ouri-kun will...

00:06:40.908 --> 00:06:43.918
The ability of Toya of
the Seven Stars is unknown.

00:06:43.918 --> 00:06:48.848
We can't afford to spare any more of
our forces fighting an unknown enemy.

00:06:51.588 --> 00:06:55.578
Senior, please protect Ouri-kun.

00:07:08.778 --> 00:07:09.758
Huh?!

00:07:20.388 --> 00:07:22.958
What're you doing?

00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:24.588
Hazama-san!

00:07:24.588 --> 00:07:27.358
Don't go too close to Hokuto.

00:07:27.358 --> 00:07:30.798
If you interest her, you'll die.

00:07:30.798 --> 00:07:32.598
I know.

00:07:32.598 --> 00:07:39.108
To Hokuto-san, understanding others
means nothing but destroying them.

00:07:39.108 --> 00:07:43.538
Because that's the only thing
others did to her.

00:07:44.378 --> 00:07:48.278
Was the Scripture on
Shikabane Hime Laws interesting?

00:07:48.278 --> 00:07:50.778
Did you guys attack the Hoshimuras

00:07:50.778 --> 00:07:56.658
in order to take the Scripture for
creating Shikabane Hime from the start?

00:07:56.658 --> 00:07:58.788
That was the course of events.

00:07:58.788 --> 00:08:03.488
We needed that literature in
order to understand Shikabane Hime.

00:08:04.128 --> 00:08:06.728
But another reason we did it was...

00:08:06.728 --> 00:08:10.438
To create a Shikabane
named Makina Hoshimura.

00:08:10.438 --> 00:08:14.838
We needed an enemy for Hokuto.

00:08:14.838 --> 00:08:18.108
We needed a reason for Hokuto to
see the Kougon Sect as her enemy.

00:08:18.108 --> 00:08:22.148
It hurts... It hurts... It hurts...

00:08:22.148 --> 00:08:24.178
It hurts... It hurts!

00:08:24.178 --> 00:08:28.088
Hokuto doesn't have regrets.
She doesn't have nature, either.

00:08:28.088 --> 00:08:31.458
She's a Shikabane who just exists.

00:08:31.458 --> 00:08:34.788
That's precisely why she
can be a symbol for Shikabane.

00:08:34.788 --> 00:08:39.298
So you destroy the Kougon Sect
using that symbol, huh?

00:08:39.298 --> 00:08:41.298
You have a problem?

00:08:41.298 --> 00:08:46.208
Good grief. The boy dashed out.

00:08:46.208 --> 00:08:49.678
You mean Hizuchi? He's hopeless.

00:08:49.678 --> 00:08:53.848
He doesn't seem to like Toya's
way of doing things by any means.

00:08:53.848 --> 00:08:58.818
Let him be. Following our
nature is how we, the Seven Stars, are.

00:08:58.818 --> 00:09:01.448
Can you afford to be so relaxed?!

00:09:01.448 --> 00:09:05.618
All you need to worry about
is quickly deciphering that book.

00:09:26.148 --> 00:09:29.548
If I'm not mistaken, that's Nozomi Kasuga.

00:09:29.548 --> 00:09:31.478
Makina-san...

00:09:32.718 --> 00:09:35.018
You shouldn't go into the school right now.

00:09:35.018 --> 00:09:38.008
There's something going
on in there right now.

00:09:38.558 --> 00:09:43.098
Nothing is going on. It's just
that everyone is becoming happy.

00:09:43.098 --> 00:09:45.598
Do you know something?

00:09:45.598 --> 00:09:48.998
I admired you.

00:09:48.998 --> 00:09:51.168
I'm not worthy of that.

00:09:51.168 --> 00:09:53.708
I was wondering why...

00:09:53.708 --> 00:09:56.538
I thought you were beautiful.

00:09:56.538 --> 00:09:59.708
I realized...

00:09:59.708 --> 00:10:01.718
you're dead...

00:10:01.718 --> 00:10:05.948
and you're already eternal...
that's why you're beautiful.

00:10:05.948 --> 00:10:09.418
That's why... Ouri-kun likes you.

00:10:09.418 --> 00:10:12.928
Ouri? You like Ouri...

00:10:12.928 --> 00:10:15.188
But it's okay.

00:10:16.258 --> 00:10:20.198
I can become... eternal soon, too.

00:10:21.228 --> 00:10:22.758
Look.

00:10:37.118 --> 00:10:40.148
How is it? Don't you feel happy?

00:10:40.148 --> 00:10:46.248
That balloon swallows your happiness
and grows bigger and bigger.

00:10:50.758 --> 00:10:51.988
Makina!

00:10:52.928 --> 00:10:54.228
Are you okay?

00:10:55.168 --> 00:10:57.998
Th-That girl...

00:10:57.998 --> 00:11:01.108
Hurry up and catch her.

00:11:01.108 --> 00:11:06.248
She isn't a Shikabane, yet.
She's just being used by the Seven Stars.

00:11:06.248 --> 00:11:07.278
But you are...

00:11:07.278 --> 00:11:09.178
Go! Now!

00:11:12.618 --> 00:11:15.608
She's waiting for you.

00:11:27.128 --> 00:11:32.128
Why do you fight it so much?
When you can become happy...

00:12:20.488 --> 00:12:22.588
Eating others' happiness...

00:12:22.588 --> 00:12:24.078
I get it now.

00:12:25.928 --> 00:12:28.158
You shouldn't do that.

00:12:33.998 --> 00:12:34.928
What?

00:12:52.348 --> 00:12:57.058
Good job. Good job.
Everyone died happy.

00:12:57.058 --> 00:12:58.218
You bastard!

00:12:58.218 --> 00:13:02.798
Don't worry. It was just a matter of time...

00:13:02.798 --> 00:13:08.938
because once the monster named
happiness grows, it'll eat them up.

00:13:08.938 --> 00:13:12.438
You call it happiness?

00:13:12.438 --> 00:13:13.708
That's right.

00:13:13.708 --> 00:13:18.778
I'm just letting them die
at the peak of that happiness.

00:13:18.778 --> 00:13:23.268
What's happy about dying?

00:13:24.648 --> 00:13:28.948
How is it? You started
feeling happy, too, right?

00:13:44.268 --> 00:13:50.108
Keep becoming happier
and happier, and let it grow...

00:13:50.108 --> 00:13:54.008
the monster named happiness...

00:14:00.618 --> 00:14:02.608
Kasuga-san...

00:14:21.808 --> 00:14:27.178
Kasuga-san! Wake up!
You're being used by a Shikabane!

00:14:27.178 --> 00:14:29.838
I'm happy.

00:14:31.048 --> 00:14:35.188
Ouri-kun, I want to become
a Shikabane Hime.

00:14:35.188 --> 00:14:36.458
What?!

00:14:36.458 --> 00:14:40.728
I want to die and become a
Shikabane Hime, just like Makina-san...

00:14:40.728 --> 00:14:45.198
Then, I'll be able to be with you.

00:14:45.198 --> 00:14:47.828
Stop talking like that!

00:14:49.498 --> 00:14:51.968
With you...

00:14:52.808 --> 00:14:54.898
Snap out of it!

00:15:04.378 --> 00:15:06.248
Ushi! Sumi!

00:15:06.248 --> 00:15:08.018
Did you do this?!

00:15:08.018 --> 00:15:11.918
Everyone wants to be happy...
just like I do...

00:15:11.918 --> 00:15:16.828
This happiness you speak of...
is to die, isn't it?!

00:15:23.868 --> 00:15:25.028
Stop it!

00:15:27.238 --> 00:15:28.878
Kasuga-san...

00:15:28.878 --> 00:15:33.348
If the balloon is busted, I'll die...

00:15:33.348 --> 00:15:35.848
Kasuga-san, snap out of it!

00:15:35.848 --> 00:15:41.248
Huh? Yeah... I wonder what I'm saying.

00:15:41.248 --> 00:15:47.888
But I'm so happy because
I can be with you right now.

00:15:47.888 --> 00:15:53.268
So... So... I wanna stay like this...

00:15:53.268 --> 00:15:55.738
I don't wanna die...

00:15:55.738 --> 00:15:59.688
I don't wanna die yet.

00:16:00.808 --> 00:16:06.908
Oh? What's the matter?
When this is so much fun...

00:16:06.908 --> 00:16:08.778
Wait!

00:16:10.318 --> 00:16:12.778
I won't... let you go...

00:16:18.118 --> 00:16:22.628
Darn... It was supposed to get bigger.

00:16:22.628 --> 00:16:28.458
Oh well... Go right ahead and
be eaten by your own happiness!

00:16:36.138 --> 00:16:37.608
That's right.

00:16:37.608 --> 00:16:41.778
When you were small, you could just
play without worrying about anything.

00:16:41.778 --> 00:16:45.278
That's the form of your happiness.

00:16:45.278 --> 00:16:48.518
You wanna go back to that time, right?

00:16:51.488 --> 00:16:53.928
I'll tell you something.

00:16:53.928 --> 00:16:57.188
If I could ever be happy...

00:16:59.298 --> 00:17:02.458
it'll only be when all of you
are destroyed, Seven Stars!

00:17:13.708 --> 00:17:17.008
I'll destroy your nature, too!

00:17:28.188 --> 00:17:30.188
What? Ah!

00:17:39.138 --> 00:17:41.008
You...

00:17:41.008 --> 00:17:45.998
Tell me... is happiness different from death?

00:17:47.908 --> 00:17:50.918
What're you... saying?

00:17:50.918 --> 00:17:54.348
I heard that she had a
good-for-nothing, poor family,

00:17:54.348 --> 00:17:58.018
and she had never
even had a decent meal.

00:17:58.018 --> 00:18:03.698
One day, they suddenly decided that
they'd all go to an amusement park.

00:18:03.698 --> 00:18:05.988
Daddy! Mommy!

00:18:09.768 --> 00:18:13.708
Whoa! Hurry up! Hurry up! Over here!

00:18:15.508 --> 00:18:21.248
It was fun. I ate delicious food.
They bought me everything I wanted.

00:18:21.248 --> 00:18:25.348
It was the first time that I ever played
with my mommy and daddy all day long.

00:18:25.348 --> 00:18:31.618
I felt really happy. I thought
those things were happiness.

00:18:33.428 --> 00:18:38.728
It was so much fun.
I've been having fun all this time...

00:18:39.728 --> 00:18:42.928
This is happiness.

00:18:43.768 --> 00:18:48.738
She fell victim to a family
suicide at her happiest moment...

00:18:48.738 --> 00:18:52.278
and doesn't even know she's dead.

00:18:52.278 --> 00:18:57.618
That's why to her, happiness
has become the same as death.

00:18:57.618 --> 00:19:01.048
No way... Death isn't happiness!

00:19:01.048 --> 00:19:07.428
Don't lie! You can fight us because
you died and became a Shikabane Hime.

00:19:07.428 --> 00:19:09.928
Isn't that happiness?!

00:19:09.928 --> 00:19:11.158
No, it isn't!

00:19:20.938 --> 00:19:24.478
You must know it in your heart, too...

00:19:24.478 --> 00:19:30.148
that people can finally
become happy by dying.

00:19:30.148 --> 00:19:32.788
Toya, take her with you.

00:19:32.788 --> 00:19:35.688
Hazama wanted her, right?

00:19:35.688 --> 00:19:38.678
I'll go take care of some leftover business.

00:19:41.458 --> 00:19:47.968
I thought I could be with you
if I became a Shikabane Hime.

00:19:47.968 --> 00:19:52.438
I thought you'd look at me too if I died.

00:19:52.438 --> 00:19:57.708
But I'd rather be with you alive.

00:19:57.708 --> 00:20:01.438
That's how it should be, right?
How stupid...

00:20:04.848 --> 00:20:08.148
This is my happiness?

00:20:10.718 --> 00:20:12.488
Kasuga-san! Let's get out of here!

00:20:16.358 --> 00:20:19.628
Brother, please help me one more time!

00:20:21.698 --> 00:20:23.398
Zadan technique!

00:20:30.308 --> 00:20:33.008
Zadan technique, you said?

00:20:33.008 --> 00:20:34.978
There's no way you can cause a miracle

00:20:34.978 --> 00:20:37.578
using the protection of
the gods and stars, is there...

00:20:37.578 --> 00:20:39.248
What?!

00:20:39.248 --> 00:20:44.048
It's not possible, since
you're the child of a Shikabane.

00:20:47.658 --> 00:20:53.388
Quiet, Ouri is my prey.
Shut up, you small fry!

00:21:01.238 --> 00:21:03.538
Kasuga-san?!

00:21:03.538 --> 00:21:05.438
What's wrong, Kasuga-san?!

00:21:05.438 --> 00:21:09.518
That balloon was her happiness.

00:21:09.518 --> 00:21:11.948
It was her second self.

00:21:11.948 --> 00:21:15.118
Once it disappears, she, too, will...

00:21:15.118 --> 00:21:17.888
Kasuga-san! Kasuga-san!

00:21:17.888 --> 00:21:20.528
Ouri... - kun...

00:21:20.528 --> 00:21:29.368
Please... make me... a Shikabane... Hime...

00:21:53.888 --> 00:22:01.568
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:01.568 --> 00:22:05.598
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:05.598 --> 00:22:13.278
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:13.278 --> 00:22:21.188
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:23.918 --> 00:22:29.698
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:29.698 --> 00:22:35.628
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:35.628 --> 00:22:41.468
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:41.468 --> 00:22:47.278
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:47.278 --> 00:22:52.348
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:52.348 --> 00:23:00.128
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:00.128 --> 00:23:04.158
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:04.158 --> 00:23:11.838
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:11.838 --> 00:23:19.708
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:24.218 --> 00:23:26.518
So you remember now...

00:23:26.518 --> 00:23:29.858
The Shikabane of abandoned brothers...

00:23:29.858 --> 00:23:32.588
"My mother was defiled."

00:23:32.588 --> 00:23:38.718
Is what's inside the scream despair or joy?
